          "slug": "europe/rauch-frederick-the-great-equestrian-monument-b23caa",
          "text": "A mounted king crowns a pedestal crowded with historical figures and reliefs. Rauch’s monument turns authority into a vertical hierarchy: one ruler above many supporting people. The capture includes the sculpted pedestal, allowing the claim to power to be compared from every side."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "/additionalExhibitions/0/works",
      "appendOnly": true,
      "beforeCount": 19,
      "afterCount": 20,
      "added": [
        {
          "slug": "europe/rauch-general-von-buelow-monument-65dd2f",
          "text": "1822. Rauch’s marble monument raises General von Bülow above an inscribed pedestal and reliefs. Uniform, sword and sweeping drapery turn military commemoration into an idealized public image. Compare this celebrated leader with the wounded and captive figures elsewhere: whose experience becomes the lasting face of a victory?"
        }
      ]
    }
